{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19952","headline":"汝州陆中丞席喜张从事至同赋十韵 · 孟郊","name":"汝州陆中丞席喜张从事至同赋十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汝水无浊波，汝山饶奇石。\n大贤爲此郡，佳士来如积。\n有客乘白驹，奉义惬所适。\n清风荡华馆，雅瑟泛瑶席。\n芳醑静无喧，金尊光有涤。\n纵情孰虑损，听论自招益。\n愿折若木枝，却彼曜灵夕。\n贵贱一相接，忧悰忽转易。\n会合勿言轻，别离古来惜。\n请君驻征车，良遇难再觌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}